parts.text:
Now MusicPlayerView.java. Edits:
1. `View mainArea = ZStack.of(Alignment.BOTTOM_CENTER, ...)` → `ZStack.with(z -> z.alignment(Alignment.BOTTOM_CENTER)).children(...)`.
2. `HStack.of(...).with(Border...).with(Shadow...)` → `HStack.children(...).modifiers(Border...).modifiers(Shadow...)`.
3. `View wideRow = HStack.of(mainArea, new NowPlayingSidebar(...).with(Clipped.of())).with(Frame.of(FILL,FILL));` → `HStack.children(mainArea, NowPlayingSidebar.with... ).modifiers(...)`. But `new NowPlayingSidebar(...).with(Clipped.of())` — `NowPlayingSidebar` is a custom View (not Configurable with builder), so `.with` instance method. Keep `.with(Clipped.with())`.
4. `View compactRow = HStack.of(mainArea).with(Frame...)` → `HStack.children(mainArea).modifiers(Frame.with(...))`.
